    <node id="src.intellicrack.main._setup_qt_and_splash">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_setup_qt_and_splash</data>
      <data key="d5">['logger']</data>
      <data key="d4">Set up Qt application with theme, icons, and splash screen.

Phase 1 imports only PyQt6.QtWidgets, creates QApplication and shows
a minimal QSplashScreen immediately for visual feedback.
Phase 2 imports the heavier UI resource modules (ThemeManager,
IconManager, SplashScreen) and swaps in the full splash.

Args:
    logger: Logger for error reporting.

Returns:
    Tuple of (app, splash) or None if imports failed.</data>
    </node>
