      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.bridges.__init__</data>
      <data key="d4">Tool bridges for external reverse engineering tools.

This package provides bridge interfaces for controlling external tools
including Ghidra, x64dbg, Frida, Cutter/Rizin, and direct binary/process manipulation.</data>
