      <data key="d3">_collect_from_binary_bridge</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'strings', 'source_bridges', 'notes']</data>
      <data key="d4">Collect string data from the BinaryBridge.

Args:
    strings: Accumulator list for discovered strings.
    source_bridges: Accumulator list for contributing bridge names.
    notes: Accumulator list for analysis notes.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.analysis_aggregator._collect_from_static_bridge">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_collect_from_static_bridge</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'bridge_name', 'strings', 'imports', 'exports', 'functions', 'source_bridges', 'notes']</data>
      <data key="d4">Collect data from a static analysis bridge (Ghidra or Cutter).

Args:
    bridge_name: Name of the bridge ("ghidra" or "cutter").
    strings: Accumulator list for discovered strings.
    imports: Accumulator list for import entries.
