      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.core.orchestrator</data>
      <data key="d4">Main AI agent orchestrator for Intellicrack.

This module provides the central orchestration layer that coordinates
between the user, LLM providers, and tool bridges to execute
reverse engineering workflows.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">OrchestratorConfig</data>
      <data key="d4">Configuration for the orchestrator.

Attributes:
    confirmation_level: When to ask for user confirmation.
    max_iterations: Maximum tool call iterations per request.
    timeout_seconds: Timeout for LLM requests.
    temperature: LLM temperature setting.
    max_tokens: Maximum tokens in LLM response.
    stream_responses: Whether to stream LLM responses.
    stream_mode: Streaming mode ("auto", "always", "never").</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.orchestrator.PendingConfirmation">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
