    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.process_manager.terminate_tree">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">terminate_tree</data>
      <data key="d5">['pid', 'graceful_timeout', 'force_timeout']</data>
      <data key="d4">Terminate a process tree using psutil.

Kills the root process and all its descendants. First sends
SIGTERM and waits for graceful_timeout, then sends SIGKILL
to any survivors and waits for force_timeout.

Args:
    pid: Root process ID.
    graceful_timeout: Seconds to wait for SIGTERM.
    force_timeout: Seconds to wait for SIGKILL.</data>
    </node>
