    <node id="src.intellicrack.core._subprocess">
      <data key="d0">module</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">D:\Intellicrack\src\intellicrack\core\_subprocess.py</data>
      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.core._subprocess</data>
      <data key="d4">Subprocess utilities wrapper.

Centralizes subprocess access to a single auditable location. All modules
that need subprocess functionality should import from this module rather
than importing directly from the subprocess standard library module.

Uses dynamic import to avoid triggering the S404 linter rule at runtime.
Type information is provided by the companion .pyi type definition file.</data>
    </node>
