    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.app._apply_tool_settings">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_apply_tool_settings</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'settings']</data>
      <data key="d4">Apply tool configuration settings at runtime.

The ToolConfigDialog handles persistence via its own JSON config file.
This method updates runtime state: for tools that have a changed path
or enabled state, it schedules re-initialization through the orchestrator.

Args:
