    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.cutter_panel">
      <data key="d0">module</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">D:\Intellicrack\src\intellicrack\ui\panels\cutter_panel.py</data>
      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.ui.panels.cutter_panel</data>
      <data key="d4">Cutter/Rizin analysis panel for Intellicrack.

Provides native Qt views for disassembly, decompilation, function listing,
CFG visualization, string search, import/export/section tables,
cross-references, and a raw r2 command console -- all powered by the
CutterBridge headless analysis backend via r2pipe.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="intellicrack.ui.highlighter" />
    <node id="intellicrack.ui.panels.base_panel" />
    <node id="intellicrack.ui.panels.graph_view" />
    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.cutter_panel.CutterPanel">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">CutterPanel</data>
      <data key="d4">Native Qt panel for Cutter/Rizin reverse engineering analysis.

Displays disassembly, decompiled code, CFG graphs, function lists,
strings, imports, exports, sections, cross-references, and a raw
r2 command console -- all driven by the CutterBridge headless
backend via r2pipe.</data>
    </node>
