    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.x64dbg_panel">
      <data key="d0">module</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">D:\Intellicrack\src\intellicrack\ui\panels\x64dbg_panel.py</data>
      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.ui.panels.x64dbg_panel</data>
      <data key="d4">x64dbg debugger panel for Intellicrack.

Provides disassembly, register inspection, breakpoint management,
memory viewing, stack traces, and command console for interactive
debugging via the X64DbgBridge backend.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.x64dbg_panel.X64DbgPanel">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">X64DbgPanel</data>
      <data key="d4">Native Qt panel for x64dbg interactive debugging.

Displays disassembly, registers, breakpoints, memory dumps,
stack traces, and a command console for controlling x64dbg
via the X64DbgBridge backend.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="intellicrack.bridges.x64dbg" />
