      <data key="d3">get_resource_path</data>
      <data key="d5">['resource_path']</data>
      <data key="d4">Resolve a resource path relative to the assets directory.

Args:
    resource_path: Relative path to the resource within assets directory.
        Forward slashes are automatically converted to OS-specific separators.

Returns:
